        "created_at": "2026-08-06T20:43:38.494Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looks like the Dalaran Realm has crapped out. Are we going to have a multi-realm crash again already!?</p>\n<p>According to <strong><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/game/status/us\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Realm Status page</a></strong> it’s still up, but login screen is showing it as down… just like last time.</p>\n<p>EDIT 1: Well, now the <strong><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/game/status/us\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Realm Status page</a></strong>  is showing it (along with tons of others) as down. So looks like the exact same issue. Blizzard didn’t pay their electricity bill. :-\\</p>\n<p>EDIT 2: Well the <strong><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/game/status/us\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Realm Status page</a></strong>  is showing the realms as coming back up…. and it  looks like I can log in again, so whatever it was they “seem to” have a handle on it and can recover quickly, but they still can’t seem to prevent it from happening. Maybe it they employed <em>REAL</em> GM’s instead of stupid AI agents the damn app would stay  up for longer than 24 hours in a row.</p>",
